<title>SWEDEN: Swedbank says has 90% of Foreningsbanken.</title>
<headline>Swedbank says has 90% of Foreningsbanken.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish commercial bank Swedbank said on Tuesday it had received acceptances from more than 90 percent of shareholders in Foreningsbanken, clearing the merger between the two banks.</p>
</text>
